+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ 8b. Fast mode (Jared, G1 item 15; the strike, 3D) */
+/* OWNER of this block: Neon icons, surface step 3D (2026-10-02). The Fast bolt is drawn only while Fast mode is on
+   (the composer model chip and the picker's model row .fast-bolt, the transcript meta .meta-fast, the model sidecar's
