+   lightning, never shaking or moving as a whole (Jared, 2026-10-02: "think of lightning being a crack, like you see
+   lightning coming down from the sky"):
+     1. the crack: the lit bolt snaps dark and its four bands (neon-icons.js lightning: spike, zig, neck, point) light
+        top to bottom, 40 ms apart, so the whole bolt cracks down in about 130 ms;
+     2. the flash: the halo and the backlight spike, dip, and flash again, like a real strike's return stroke;
