+/* ===================================================================================================== Pointer */
+/* ---- Square pointer [pointer]: the images (literal colours) are in nier.css's generated block ---- */
+
+/* ======================================================================================================= World */
+/* ---- Square icon strokes [icons]: every icon draws with square caps and mitred joins (the neon family's own rule,
